# Vercel's agent-skills, cloned whole. It carries its own .git, so committing it
# would leave a gitlink nobody can check out. The taste skill under .agents/ is
# plain files and is committed, pinned by skills-lock.json.
agent-skills/

# Camera-original footage. The hero video in public/video/ is derived from it
# by scripts/hero-video.sh — a 92 MB 4K vertical .mov becoming a 1 MB 720p
# loop. Committing the source would roughly double this repository for a file
# nothing reads at build or run time, and a big binary in git history cannot
# be taken back out without rewriting it. Keep the originals with the rest of
# the shoot, not here.
*.mov
*.MOV
